[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0158","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0158.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2872","title":"Apple WebKit 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WebKit 渲染引擎在处理特定网页内容时存在内存损坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问一个经过精心构建的恶意网站，触发 WebKit 内部的内存管理缺陷，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码或导致浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响 Apple iOS 5.1 之前的版本以及 iTunes 10.6 之前的版本。攻击条件为用户使用受影响的浏览器访问恶意页面，利用方式为通过精心设计的 HTML/JavaScript 载荷触发内存破坏。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2872"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:09Z","remediation":"建议将 iOS 系统升级至 5.1 或更高版本，并将 iTunes 升级至 10.6 或更高版本。对于无法立即升级的设备，建议暂时禁用 Safari 浏览器访问不可信的第三方网站，以防止通过恶意网页触发内存损坏导致的代码执行或服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/79911","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52365","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73801","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17438","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2872.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2872","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2872.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d3362e5d3b95223fab83ca531e4c3b2a7ca274a/2011/CVE-2011-2872.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2872.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/C