款Apple产品的基础组件。攻击条件相对简单，只需要受害者访问恶意网站即可触发，该漏洞评估基于CVSS 9.3评分，属于危急等级。攻击者可完全控制受影响应用程序，窃取敏感数据，或破坏系统完整性。该漏洞属于CWE-119类型的内存控制错误，目前已在2012年3月发布的的安全更新中修复，建议用户尽快更新至安全版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2867"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:08Z","remediation":"立即更新 Apple iOS 至 5.1.1 或更高版本，并更新 iTunes 至 10.6.2 或更高版本，以获取针对 WebKit 中该内存破坏漏洞的修复。升级后请验证补丁已生效。如无法立即更新，可临时通过修改 Safari 的网络设置白名单机制来限制网页访问，降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/79906","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52365","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73796","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2867.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2867","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2867.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fa386d759f2a771540ca69b5fc06cb6091dcd950/2011/CVE-2011-2867.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2867.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2867.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2867.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-28xx/CVE-2011-2867.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2867.json","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2011-2867.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0153.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0152","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0152.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2866","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 内存破坏漏洞","description":"WebKit浏览器引擎核心组件存在未明内存破坏漏洞，攻击者可通过精心构造的网页触发利用，导致远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响基于WebKit内核的Safari浏览器及相关产品。攻击者无需身份验证即可通过恶意网站实现浏览器利用，攻击路径隐蔽且影响范围广泛。漏洞利用可能导致敏感数据泄露、系统控制权丢失等严重安全风险。Apple已确认漏洞真实性，计划在后续安全更新中提供修复，但用户应及时升级到最新版本以获取保护。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2866"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-08T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apple iTunes 至 10.6 或更高版本（通过 Apple 软件更新或从 apple.com/cn/itunes 下载）。作为临时缓解措施，避免在不受信的网络环境（如公共 Wi-Fi）中浏览 iTunes Store，并启用系统防火墙阻止非受信网络的中间人攻击。Apple 官方安全公告参考：APPLE-SA-2012-03-07-1。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/79957","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52363","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73762","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17368","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2866.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2866","