户访问包含恶意 SVG 动画元素的网页触发该漏洞，导致浏览器崩溃造成拒绝服务，或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞源于 WebKit 渲染引擎在处理 SVG 动画元素时内存管理不当，释放内存后仍继续引用已释放对象。影响 Google Chrome 17.0.963.65 之前所有版本，攻击者需构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，CVSS 评分 6.8（中等），属于 CWE-416 使用后释放类型漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3044"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-05T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:29Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 17.0.963.65 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 菜单→帮助→关于 Google Chrome 自动检查更新并重启浏览器完成修复。若无法立即更新，可暂时禁用 SVG 动画或使用扩展禁用 SVG 渲染作为临时缓解措施，并尽快安排浏览器升级。建议同时开启 Chrome 自动更新功能，确保后续安全补丁及时获取。如在企业环境，可通过组策略或 Chrome Enterprise 策略强制推送更新至所有终端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=116093","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00012.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48419","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52271","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73655","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14830","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3044","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3044","https://github.com