le.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00012.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48419","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52271","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73654","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15077","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3043.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3043","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3043","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3043.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3043","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3043","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3043.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3043.yml","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2011-3043","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3043"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0186.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0186.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0185","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0185.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3042","title":"Google Chrome 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 17.0.963.65 之前版本在处理 HTML 表格节点（table sections）时存在 Use-After-Free（使用后释放）内存安全漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意网页，触发浏览器在释放表格相关 DOM 对象后继续访问已释放的内存区域，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能利用内存布局控制实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Chrome 17.0.963.65 之前所有版本，攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意页面即可触发，无需用户交互即可触发漏洞利用。CVSS 评分 6.8（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于中高危漏洞。Google 已在 Chrome 17.0.963.65 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3042"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-05T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:29Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 到 17.0.963.65 或更高版本，关闭“使用系统默认字体”功能，并启用 Chrome 安全标签模式，通过 RTL 渲染引擎沙箱预防潜在利用。如无法立即更新，可 temporarily 将 Chrome 的“Auto-select Web Framework”设为 \"None\" 并禁用 PDF 嵌入预览功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=114219","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00012.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48419","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52271","http://www.securitytracke