漏洞，该漏洞位于 V8 JavaScript 引擎对引号（quote）的处理逻辑中。远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的特制网页，诱使目标用户访问后触发内存释放后仍被引用的问题，导致浏览器崩溃或拒绝服务，并可能造成任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Google Chrome 的用户，CVSS 评分为 6.8，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3039"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-03-05T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:29Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 17.0.963.65 或更高版本。用户可通过 Chrome 的「设置」→「关于 Chrome」自动检测并安装更新；如无法自动更新，请前往 https://www.google.com/chrome 手动下载安装最新稳定版。如暂时无法升级，可在防火墙或代理层面限制访问包含恶意引号内容构造的网页，临时缓解远程攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=113707","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/03/chrome-stable-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-03/msg00012.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48419","http://secunia.com/advisories/48527","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201203-19.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52271","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73650","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14904","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3039.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3039","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3039","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74